---
import { product } from '../content/product';
---
<section class="border-t border-graphite"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] gap-10 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-6 lg:py-28"><div><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ash">READY TO CODE?</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-normal leading-[1.08] text-white sm:text-4xl">准备好开始了吗？</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-mist">下载 BeCoder Windows 版，直接进入准备就绪的 C/C++ 环境。</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-md bg-lime px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-void transition-transform hover:-translate-y-px" href={product.releaseUrl}>下载 BeCoder</a><a class="rounded-md border border-graphite px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-mist hover:border-smoke hover:text-white" href={product.releasePageUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 Release</a></div></div><div class="border-t border-graphite pt-8 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-12 lg:pt-0"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ash">OPEN SOURCE</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-normal leading-[1.08] text-white sm:text-4xl">在开放中构建。</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-base leading-7 text-mist">BeCoder 使用 GPL-3.0-or-later。可在 GitHub 查看源码、Release、Issues 与 Discussions。</p><a class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md border border-graphite px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-mist hover:border-smoke hover:text-white" href={product.repositoryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">在 GitHub 查看</a></div></div></section>
